CodeEditorGrammars — Tree-sitter generated C parsers
====================================================

This package contains deterministic copies of upstream Tree-sitter grammar
parser/scanner C sources, pinned by commit SHA and parser.c checksums in
../../scripts/grammars.tsv.

Each grammar retains the license of its upstream repository (typically MIT
or similar). See individual upstream URLs in grammars.tsv. Do not treat this
tree as original work of the CodeEditorView authors.

Regenerate with: ../../scripts/update-grammars.sh
Verify with:     ../../scripts/verify-grammars.sh
